    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p>&nbsp;</p><h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">《Tīm補》</span><span style=\"font-size: large;\">/</span><span style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">尤慧美</span></span></h1><div><span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: xx-large; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhFlmwPL0K9n19aN9h_bHH4zuupohtpl7sIgfGDpBSeN_xnaU4KXgN11uMkIklo1OD1VqOQEUcC8MI3G8m2TUuowavxhVS4aL7SH3ccv928qYvdtahRDE5MsNb4nWMY5A6WjWQYy07ttTmMXzVRlTR73T2SonIlzPrnMngP4pa8F9XOU-iBBIruWRjOxkWD\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhFlmwPL0K9n19aN9h_bHH4zuupohtpl7sIgfGDpBSeN_xnaU4KXgN11uMkIklo1OD1VqOQEUcC8MI3G8m2TUuowavxhVS4aL7SH3ccv928qYvdtahRDE5MsNb4nWMY5A6WjWQYy07ttTmMXzVRlTR73T2SonIlzPrnMngP4pa8F9XOU-iBBIruWRjOxkWD\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiEsLw6ZCFg8bChQjPuJjX5qRNWZkfg_wvT_ZKiZnRLqn7w62pLYaRZb3IDvs91DwMN4LMK0zM5_MFc807zLnGuek1OQNUkY6fv1GMaLi1kvjXk0ehAEmThXwM67TZJHDtQABVjuiOoh00XIIwd6TGcw_by1mf1jktLUgHoIAjRDQgYmGcwpNgs8JC1bpey\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiEsLw6ZCFg8bChQjPuJjX5qRNWZkfg_wvT_ZKiZnRLqn7w62pLYaRZb3IDvs91DwMN4LMK0zM5_MFc807zLnGuek1OQNUkY6fv1GMaLi1kvjXk0ehAEmThXwM67TZJHDtQABVjuiOoh00XIIwd6TGcw_by1mf1jktLUgHoIAjRDQgYmGcwpNgs8JC1bpey\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi2dE5zb7-w1PTQrNUXICsJgbuf8pmiiS2IzOrb3UbeUfMWdbH9e1Udh8xgYWzCh2xiGmrFhxpp_37YVyo7htOrAXcpoRcmGWEjWdBd_oXql7N61FTzXVCVjJMRQcJ4zMUa1vwYFM88YIR4VOB1Qat2jXZy4q0IdLwsTYvRiEchQU-Zk8DiQGyQv111aouV\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi2dE5zb7-w1PTQrNUXICsJgbuf8pmiiS2IzOrb3UbeUfMWdbH9e1Udh8xgYWzCh2xiGmrFhxpp_37YVyo7htOrAXcpoRcmGWEjWdBd_oXql7N61FTzXVCVjJMRQcJ4zMUa1vwYFM88YIR4VOB1Qat2jXZy4q0IdLwsTYvRiEchQU-Zk8DiQGyQv111aouV\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEh7kU-5cNdgKe13Dn7tUS0vKLdzBYzsG3Xm9BEJkzz0lotIrYlUh25GF6aJkyGtOfR-yHOFVlrR_pPHA0x-WNVgrF-7dTrIgvYyjYE4x7g3xVvimR3qUBmMS7_2LfvP3pPIZbqw_qqS8WUXGYkOehRdBSp0dHn2HDgrTOWvht4nXzJRov8CzxkufGb0RpwP\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEh7kU-5cNdgKe13Dn7tUS0vKLdzBYzsG3Xm9BEJkzz0lotIrYlUh25GF6aJkyGtOfR-yHOFVlrR_pPHA0x-WNVgrF-7dTrIgvYyjYE4x7g3xVvimR3qUBmMS7_2LfvP3pPIZbqw_qqS8WUXGYkOehRdBSp0dHn2HDgrTOWvht4nXzJRov8CzxkufGb0RpwP\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEh9zlLHKXn0ausMjHsC3f5y44pzjp671zuns7e1b11m37KEfXd_ZTVw21oCh_caVHyTP0DSY4OHgMqj12jWHgIFT1v99naeGQAQrbcyofRghv8GpFAVDs2LR7ikq-rHzNO4xD10Njv1QPxlEqrDQbNjtMA1RuCPKUVy2xpMIYoRRM-_GntT-E-W9MHNSv62\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEh9zlLHKXn0ausMjHsC3f5y44pzjp671zuns7e1b11m37KEfXd_ZTVw21oCh_caVHyTP0DSY4OHgMqj12jWHgIFT1v99naeGQAQrbcyofRghv8GpFAVDs2LR7ikq-rHzNO4xD10Njv1QPxlEqrDQbNjtMA1RuCPKUVy2xpMIYoRRM-_GntT-E-W9MHNSv62\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhbgvTCwEBH3y0anvZBsdnbjLrDcIYu_PS6_WwPRaqL2awQsTuk_HzfLmqFA_yQRLVPiyNN1FdOHioex_1DDvYHz-9d_d4boIwotZa0QOlzHLD8sv5cFvz-hZ5w0Mf0fgAvexAFf8ZReDww_zHv6ue4G4umVV4xqT1EaNcpToKiLeGqqvydwA5FDrYll-uu\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"729\" data-original-width=\"516\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhbgvTCwEBH3y0anvZBsdnbjLrDcIYu_PS6_WwPRaqL2awQsTuk_HzfLmqFA_yQRLVPiyNN1FdOHioex_1DDvYHz-9d_d4boIwotZa0QOlzHLD8sv5cFvz-hZ5w0Mf0fgAvexAFf8ZReDww_zHv6ue4G4umVV4xqT1EaNcpToKiLeGqqvydwA5FDrYll-uu=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div></div><br /></div></div></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">冬節進前，雞仔鴨仔ê胸坎lóng ài挲挲、摸摸、lia̍p-lia̍p--leh！阿媽ê手bē輸秤仔，ná lia̍p ná講koh飼十外日掠來刣khah拄好，大人囡仔算算--leh十外个，ài刣三隻鴨鵤 tīm補，當歸鴨、薑母鴨、燒酒鴨，賰--ê留到過年tsiah拍算。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Hit-tsūn鴨仔聽了真煩惱，頭lê-lê恬tsiuh-tsiuh，好日子beh盡磅--ah！就án-ne無hiàng時ê好食睏，平常時仔冤家量債ê雞仔kap鴨仔，mā知影hōo人「tshńg食」ê代誌，早慢ē發生，bē閃--得。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">阿媽感覺怪奇，雞仔鴨仔飼料無食水無lim，若tio̍h-tse就去了了，tsua̋nn舂臼仔舂一面盆仔蒜頭硬tsinn。雞仔鴨仔驚hōo人刣肉假破病，tsit聲無死mā kan-ta賰半條命，hiam辣ê嚨喉leh to̍h火，目睭起霧頭殼tshìng煙。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">一隻番鴨鵤起狂大聲huah：「逃命！」Beh按怎逃命？Beh活活iau--死--ooh！番鴨鵤開喙：「等--一-下，tuè我行！」一隻一隻雞仔跟tuè一隻一隻鴨仔。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">日頭落山路燈照光，溫柔ê月娘來tshuā路，十隻鴨仔tshuā八隻雞仔e-e陣陣向前行，tsiūnn崎落崎啥mih lóng m̄驚，為著顧性命甘願拚。經過草埔仔kap檨仔園，鑽入暗sô-sô ê刺竹林，頭前淺淺ê nah坑承雨水，mā有拋hng ê番薯園好所在好生活。日--時bih--leh恬恬睏，暗頭仔出來討食。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">阿媽掠準雞仔鴨仔hōo賊仔偷掠--去，m̄知雞仔鴨仔suan去逃命，藏bóng藏，鴨卵khah ba̍t mā有縫。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Tann害--ah！Hit隻tshio-tiô ê 雞鵤假gâu，ko̍k ko̍k ko̍k，三聲thàng到半公里遠——piak空--ah！穩當ài「tīm補」！當歸鴨、薑母鴨、燒酒鴨、麻油雞、人蔘雞、香菇雞。</span></div></div><div><br /></div><div><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><h2 style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: center;\"><div style=\"font-weight: 400; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: left;\"><span><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgtA5u4OQb_Qhl5q2r99aRgS6aKK_ffPVom911metAlMvWjhnC7eRVuRvdAi-JYwGM7Kv5NwYeNdkjU8KywNl4TnmKLFayyu7KXUobnNYpeBcJi_oUfFxcS3gzUehqHADr_-1fWxkOwfySOO9cprCDdPa-Bk1I9ves5cKU6r6Bhaqq2P9NT5WHzXJsAkybW\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"3035\" data-original-width=\"2139\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgtA5u4OQb_Qhl5q2r99aRgS6aKK_ffPVom911metAlMvWjhnC7eRVuRvdAi-JYwGM7Kv5NwYeNdkjU8KywNl4TnmKLFayyu7KXUobnNYpeBcJi_oUfFxcS3gzUehqHADr_-1fWxkOwfySOO9cprCDdPa-Bk1I9ves5cKU6r6Bhaqq2P9NT5WHzXJsAkybW=w451-h640\" width=\"451\" /></a></div><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: medium;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"background-color: white; clear: both; color: #444444; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: medium;\"><b><s